  "answer_text": "Unfortunately, **The Flash (CW series) has ended**. During the course of the series, 184 episodes of *The Flash* aired over nine seasons, between October 7, 2014, and May 24, 2023.\n\n*The Flash* Season 9 was the end of the road for the series, and it also ended the Arrowverse as a whole, as The CW had canceled the last few series that made up the shared DC TV universe before Season 9 premiered.\n\nThere are currently no TV airings of *The Flash* in the next 14 days. You can add *The Flash* to your watchlist to find out if it ever comes back.\n\nSo, there will be **no new episodes** of the CW's *The Flash* unless a revival or reboot is announced. If you're interested in catching up, you can stream previous episodes on available platforms. Would you like help finding where to watch it?",
